  "notes": [
    "Targets are the three vault beacon proxies the anchor called and their three YieldBasis strategy proxies, whose swapRewardTokens approved the attacker-named aggregator for the staked gauge token. Both beacons were upgraded about two days before the exploit; the strategy beacon upgrade is the later one.",
    "Gauge shares are valued at the underlying the attacker redeemed (tBTC, cbBTC and WBTC via the yb LT tokens, LINK and stLINK via the Curve pool, WETH via the Polygon Morpho vault); the MAI/USDC.e gauge carries its DefiLlama price. The signed deadline was 90 s after the block, so the signature was freshly issued.",
    "The campaign adds a fourth Ethereum vault (Curve stLINK strategy) and two Polygon Giddy vaults: setup transactions that granted the approval, then the pulls that moved value. Approval scans of every Giddy strategy on Ethereum, Base and Arbitrum show no other unknown spender."
  ]
